{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this round-based 2.5D puzzle platformer, you solve puzzles by repeating the same level with each character and their special abilities. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Join Tamo, Mukao and Cenali on their Adventure and help them face the consequences of their own actions!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose the character you want to start with. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504610/extras/ChooseCharacter-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1739283353\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each of the characters have a unique set of abilities that will help you to navigate through the level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504610/extras/UseSpecialAbilities.gif?t=1739283353\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Be careful when you use your abilities. They might help you now but could stop you in the next run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504610/extras/BlockCharacters.gif?t=1739283353\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Only when finishing the level with each character, can you progress through the temple.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504610/extras/FinishTheLevels.gif?t=1739283353\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3504610?t=1739283353","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3504610?t=1739283353","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504610/b67018476decca41e014be2f78db9ef17d8ebbae/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1739283353","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504610/b67018476decca41e014be2f78db9ef17d8ebbae/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1739283353","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this round-based 2.5D puzzle platformer, you solve puzzles by repeating the same level with each character and their special abilities. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Join Tamo, Mukao and Cenali on their Adventure and help them face the consequences of their own actions!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose the character you want to start with. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504610/extras/ChooseCharacter-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1739283353\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each of the characters have a unique set of abilities that will help you to navigate through the level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504610/extras/UseSpecialAbilities.gif?t=1739283353\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Be careful when you use your abilities. They might help you now but could stop you in the next run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504610/extras/BlockCharacters.gif?t=1739283353\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Only when finishing the level with each character, can you progress through the temple.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504610/extras/FinishTheLevels.gif?t=1739283353\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["The Deprechoes"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description